[KingMachiavelli]: Completely different architecture, but would be amazing if another device could control what message (or photo, embedded video) is displayed. There&#x27;s a huge industry around digital signage and I&#x27;ve always felt it could be replaced with a simple Chromium kiosk + auto-refreshed webpage content. There&#x27;s really no need for expensive HDMI connections or custom video streams when we already have browsers.

